WEBVTT

00:01:56.156 --> 00:02:00.476
So many unfamiliar, bewildered faces.

00:02:01.196 --> 00:02:02.516
And beside her,

00:02:02.516 --> 00:02:07.516
a boy, about 12, holding
in his arms a large clock.

00:02:11.036 --> 00:02:12.596
“Sync successful.

00:02:12.596 --> 00:02:14.556
Activating stage two.”

00:02:15.876 --> 00:02:21.916
Suddenly, the 311 dreaming people
are high up in the air.

00:02:22.676 --> 00:02:25.076
The Earth dawns below them

00:02:25.076 --> 00:02:27.676
swathed in green and blue,

00:02:27.676 --> 00:02:30.716
punctuated by clouds and storm formations.